// MentorMatch IB DP Maths past papers: SEO for all pages
// 4 course pages + 20 topic pages + 50 paper pages = 74 pages
// Fields on every page: metaTitle, metaDescription, h1, heroText
//
// {count} in metaDescription is a placeholder. Replace it at render time:
//   topic page:  seo.metaDescription.replace('{count}', topic.totalQuestions)
//   paper page:  seo.metaDescription.replace('{count}', paper.count)
//   course page: seo.metaDescription.replace('{count}', sum of totalQuestions for that course)
//
// PYQ_COURSE_SEO is for the course landing pages (e.g. /aa-sl). Delete it if those pages do not exist.

