            question:
              'The graph of the quadratic function $$f(x) = c+bx-x^2$$ intersects the x-axis at the point A$$(-1,0)$$ and has its vertex at the point B$$(3,16)$$.\n (a) Write down the equation of the axis of symmetry for this graph. [2]\n (b) Find the value of $$b$$. [2]\n (c) Write down the range of $$f(x)$$. [2]',
