              'a. Use symmetry of the normal curve: $$0.5-0.1446=0.3554$$.\n b.(i) Standardize: $$z=-1.0598$$, solve $$\\dfrac{24.15-25}{\\sigma}=-1.0598 \\Rightarrow \\sigma=0.802$$.\n b.(ii) $$P(X>26)=0.106$$ from GDC.\n c. $$Y\\sim B(10,0.10621)$$, $$E(Y)=10\\times0.10621=1.06$$.\n d. $$P(Y=3)=0.0655$$ using binomial pmf.\n e. Conditional probability: $$P\\left(24.15<X<25 \\mid X<26\\right)=\\dfrac{0.3554}{1-0.10621}=0.398$$.',
