            solution:
              'a. $$z=2.0537 \\Rightarrow \\dfrac{82-75}{\\sigma}=2.0537 \\Rightarrow \\sigma=3.408\\approx3.41$$.\n b. $$P(T>80)=0.071193\\approx0.0712$$.\n c. $$P(T<82\\mid T>80)=\\dfrac{P(80<T<82)}{P(T>80)}=\\dfrac{0.051193}{0.071193}=0.719$$.\n d. $$X\\sim B(64,0.071193)$$: $$E(X)=64\\times0.071193=4.56$$.\n e. $$P(X>6)=1-P(X\\le6)=1-0.83088=0.169$$.',
