            question:
              'A particle moves along a straight line so that its velocity, $$v$$ m s$$^{-1}$$, after $$t$$ seconds is $$v(t)=1.4^t-2.7$$, for $$0\\le t\\le5$$.\n (a) Find when the particle is at rest. [2]\n (b) Find the acceleration of the particle when $$t=2$$. [2]\n (c) Find the total distance travelled by the particle. [3]',
