            solution:
              '(a) $$u_1 r = 30,\\ u_1 r^4=240 \\Rightarrow r^3=8 \\Rightarrow r=2$$ (M1A1)\n (b) $$u_1(2)=30 \\Rightarrow u_1=15$$ (M1A1ft)\n (c) $$\\dfrac{15(2^n-1)}{2-1}=61\\,425 \\Rightarrow n=12$$ (M1A1ft)',
