            question:
              'The diagram below is part of a Voronoi diagram (diagram not to scale). $$A$$ and $$B$$ are sites with $$B$$ having the coordinates $$(4,6)$$. $$L$$ is an edge; the equation of this perpendicular bisector of the line segment from $$A$$ to $$B$$ is $$y=-2x+9$$. Find the coordinates of the point $$A$$.',
